# 設定預設行為：所有純文字檔案在 Git 儲存庫內一律以 LF 儲存
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly declare file types (強制指定純文字檔案)
*.php text eol=lf
*.js  text eol=lf
*.ts  text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf

# 排除二進位檔案，避免 Git 誤改圖檔或壓縮檔編碼
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary